  "comments": "<p>The frailejón plant (Espeletia, a genus of perennial subshrubs, in the family Asteracea) is endemic mainly to Colombia, Venezuela, and Ecuador.<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64907466195f2.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64907466195f2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The artist Johanna Calle was the first female artist to design Colombian circulation coinage, with her designs appearing in the $100 and $500 (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"/34774\">N#34774</a>) pesos coins&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There are some varieties for all 100 pesos (especially for 2017, 2018):</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/697289099cf46.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/697289099cf46.jpg\"></a> &nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6972891b234ba.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6972891b234ba.jpg\"></a></p>",
